  "description": "<p>We are the maker of an inventive new device called the <a href=\"whisperearcare.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Whisper Ear Dryer</a>. Think hairdryer... but for your ears. Our product uses warm air to evaporate water from the ear canal, preventing Swimmer's Ear infections (and those annoying water clogged ears.)</p>\r\n<p>Ear infections are the #1 reason parents take their kids to the doctor 👨&zwj;⚕️ in the United States. We believe there is a massive opporunity in marketing our ear dryer to mothers. Every single family in America is potential costumer.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Swimmers 🏊&zwj;♂️, surfers 🏊&zwj;♂️, scuba divers 🤿, and other water sport enthusiasts are also very much a target audience.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This affiliate program offers a 10% commision on all sales. At a $60 price point the dollars can add up quickly. Payout is monthly via PayPal.</p>\r\n<p>We look forward to building a prosperous relationship with you! Please reach out to us at hello@whisperearcare.com with any questions, or ideas 💡 for how we can help you sell more ear dryers!</p>\r\n<p>➡️ We will happily provide a free sample of the product to anyone with a substantial social media following and/or track record of success.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Including Whisper, there are currently only 3 ear dryer products in existance. Our competitors, <a href=\"https://www.macksearplugs.com/product/ear-dryer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mack's</a> and <a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Electric-Dryer-Removal-Swimmers-Tilcare/dp/B09M7V4H15\">Tilcare</a>, both have devices that were designed years ago. Their products are outdated, less effective, and frankly... ugly. Whisper is the first ear dryer with modern, friendly, and functional design. This is a wide open market. 🚀🚀🚀</p>",
